From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: folia-linear-build <folia-linear-build@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Linear region format

Adds a Linear region-file format alongside vanilla anvil storage.
Region files are chosen per storage folder: Linear defers chunk
writes in memory and persists them on world save, unload, or
eviction, with broken-symlink guards and oversized-chunk handling
matching vanilla delete-and-log behavior.
---

